#import "../../../proofs.typ": speech, footnote

== 12. Of Adoption

#speech[#smallcaps[Paragraph 1]: All those that are justified, God vouchsafed, in and for the sake of His only Son Jesus Christ, to make partakers of the grace of adoption,#footnote[Ephesians 1:5; Galatians 4:4–5] by which they are taken into the number, and enjoy the liberties and privileges of the children of God,#footnote[John 1:12; Romans 8:17] have His name put on them,#footnote[2 Corinthians 6:18; Revelation 3:12] receive the spirit of adoption,#footnote[Romans 8:15] have access to the throne of grace with boldness, are enabled to cry Abba, Father,#footnote[Galatians 4:6; Ephesians 2:18] are pitied,#footnote[Psalm 103:13] protected,#footnote[Proverbs 14:26; 1 Peter 5:7] provided for,#footnote[Hebrews 12:6] and chastened by Him as by a Father,#footnote[Isaiah 54:8–9] yet never cast off,#footnote[Lamentations 3:31] but sealed to the day of redemption,#footnote[Ephesians 4:30] and inherit the promises as heirs of everlasting salvation.#footnote[Hebrews 1:14; 6:12]]
